      },
      "text": "durée",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.2134649021318104,
        "y0": 0.6675459435121136,
        "x1": 0.8622151873152254,
        "y1": 0.6817990792019655
      },
      "text": "bergsoniana; así, cuando Bajtín afirma que “toda la literatura está envuelta en el",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.1429146098520281,
        "y0": 0.6863600782730062,
        "x1": 0.8619228886683317,
        "y1": 0.700613213962858
      },
      "text": "proceso de formación” (Bajtin, 1975: 451), podemos apreciar una concepción del tiempo",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.1429146098520281,
        "y0": 0.70524547581254,
        "x1": 0.8617191715826151,
        "y1": 0.7194986115023918
      },
      "text": "afín al planteamiento de Bergson, esto es, un presente que se encuentra en un permanente",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.1429146098520281,
        "y0": 0.7240596105734326,
        "x1": 0.8637370677482278,
        "y1": 0.7383127462632844
      },
      "text": "punto de fuga. La trilogía de Linklater gravita en torno al diálogo de sus protagonistas",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.1429146098520281,
        "y0": 0.7429450081129665,
        "x1": 0.8647448880565284,
        "y1": 0.7571981438028182
      },
      "text": "como foco dramático primordial y son pocos los momentos en los que estos guardan",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.1429146098520281,
        "y0": 0.761759142873859,
        "x1": 0.6776838014901649,
        "y1": 0.7760122785637108
      },
      "text": "silencio. Incluso en esas secuencias —que incluyen las de",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.6776838014901649,
        "y0": 0.761759142873859,
        "x1": 0.8306569808963036,
        "y1": 0.7760122785637108
      },
      "text": "Before the End—",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.8426727518426277,
        "y0": 0.761759142873859,
        "x1": 0.8622252347608218,
        "y1": 0.7760122785637108
      },
      "text": "la",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.1429146098520281,
        "y0": 0.7806445404133929,
        "x1": 0.8625192763319517,
        "y1": 0.7948976761032447
      },
      "text": "comunicación no cesa y los silencios son elocuentes. Enraizados en el presente dilatado,",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.1429146098520281,
        "y0": 0.7994586751742854,
        "x1": 0.8610096988935572,
        "y1": 0.8137118108641371
      },
      "text": "Jesse y Céline encuentran la dimensión más trascendental de sus existencias en ese intento",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.1429146098520281,
        "y0": 0.8182728099351779,
        "x1": 0.8643397094341068,
        "y1": 0.8325259456250297
      },
      "text": "por conectar que brota de su charla incesante. De entre las muchas reflexiones vitales",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.1429146098520281,
        "y0": 0.8371582165366114,
        "x1": 0.8625297338773684,
        "y1": 0.8514113522264632
      },
      "text": "intercambiadas entre Jesse y Céline, la que quizás resuma con mayor acierto su filosofía",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.5803265655216154,
        "y0": 0.8893956637844664,
        "x1": 0.6944079284729483,
        "y1": 0.9000855155518552
      },
